Recommends: 7zip, unrar
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Appz4Fun/RustyGet
Description: Usenet NZB downloader (RustyGet, Rust port of NZBGet)
 RustyGet downloads NZB files with live repair from duplicate postings
 and par2, and direct unpack. Installs side by side with the nzbget
 package: own binary, data directory, config and systemd unit.
 The service is installed but not enabled or started.
